# Zigtoberfest 2026 (September 12, 2026) - 10:30 - Hoftheater München

Join us for the last [Zigtoberfest](https://zigtoberfest.de/) not organized by EuroZig!

Zigtoberfest is a mini-conference dedicated to the [Zig](https://ziglang.org/) programming language! It's the ideal place to connect and learn with other hobbyists as well as professionals in the Zig community. We come together to share our knowledge and passion for computers and programming. 

# EuroZig e.V. Inaugural Meeting (September 13, 2026) - 10:00 - InterfaceAG

EuroZig is a community of [Zig](https://ziglang.org/) enthusiasts. Our mission is to grow and support the European Zig community.

We'll host the inaugural meeting for the EuroZig e.V. on September 13, 2026 at InterfaceAG, Perchtinger Str. 8-10 81379 Munich.

You can sign up for the meeting [here](https://pretix.sugar-codeconnect.de/zigtoberfest/eurozig-ev-inaugural-meeting/).

Anyone who attends and signs the bylaws becomes a founding member and votes on all resolutions taken that day.

# Agenda
1. **Opening of the meeting and welcome**
2. **Determination of attendance and entry in the attendance list**
3. **Election of the chair of the meeting and of the keeper of the minutes**
4. **Discussion and adoption of the bylaws**
5. **Election of the three board members and of the auditor**
6. **Setting the membership fees and adoption of the membership fee regulations**
7. **Adoption of the remuneration regulations**
8. **Any other business**
    - anything that came up during the meeting
    - future plans/events etc.

The draft bylaws, membership fee regulations and remuneration regulations are available
on [GitHub](https://github.com/EuroZig/org). If you want to propose changes, make a PR.
